{"id":"gewohnheit","lemma":"Gewohnheit","pos":"noun","rank":4929,"glosses":["habit"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0c/De-Gewohnheit.ogg/De-Gewohnheit.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Gewohnheit","plural":"Gewohnheiten"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich muss meine Gewohnheiten ändern.","en":"I have to change my habits.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"to change, to alter"}]},{"text":"Es wurde zur Gewohnheit.","en":"It became habit.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe viele schlechte Gewohnheiten.","en":"I have a lot of bad habits.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},{"g":"bad","l":"schlecht"},null]},{"text":"Das ist eine Frage der Gewohnheit.","en":"It's a matter of habit.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"question"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Alte Gewohnheiten wird man schwer los.","en":"Old habits are hard to break.","words":[{"g":"age, old age","l":"Alter"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"one"},{"g":"heavy, weighty"},{"g":"rid of, free of"}]}]}